[Document(id='265a7cd3-cb77-444b-9cfc-1d1a0ea294f3', metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/data/Document_1_IITJ_Knowledge_Base.docx'}, page_content='Board of Governors\n\nSenate\n\nDirector\n\nRegistrar\n\nAcademic Departments\n\n3. Campus Overview\n\nThe permanent campus is located near Karwar village outside Jodhpur city and includes academic buildings, hostels, laboratories, library, sports facilities, medical centre and student activity spaces.\n\n4. Admissions\n\nAdmission Process\n\nQualify JEE Main (eligibility for JEE Advanced).\n\nAppear for JEE Advanced.\n\nRegister through JoSAA.\n\nParticipate in choice filling and seat allocation.\n\nComplete fee payment and document verification.\n\nReport to IIT Jodhpur and complete hostel registration.\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\n\nQ. What is JoSAA?\n\nA. The Joint Seat Allocation Authority coordinates admissions into IITs and other participating institutes.\n\nQ. Is IIT Jodhpur residential?'), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Doc 10_ IIT Jodhpur Admissions & Fee Guide.docx'}, page_content='JoSAA\n\nCSAB\n\nJEE Advanced\n\nRegistration\n\nFee Structure\n\nScholarships\n\nDocuments Required\n\nInstitute Registration\n\nCourse Registration\n\nFee Payment\n\nRefund Policy\n\nStudent ID\n\nInstitute Email'), Document(id='7ffa320f-3bc7-4d3a-89e5-9ca6c3f3c485', metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/data/Document_1_IITJ_Knowledge_Base.docx'}, page_content='IIT Jodhpur Knowledge Base\n\nDocument 1: Institute Overview, Administration, Campus Overview & Admissions\nVersion: 1.0\nPurpose: Production-ready RAG Knowledge Base\nSource: Official IIT Jodhpur website (expanded with explanatory content)\n\n\nMetadata\n\nField\n\nValue\n\nKnowledge Domain\n\nInstitutional Information\n\nAudience\n\nProspective students, current students, parents, visitors\n\nDocument Format\n\nRAG Optimized\n\nTopics\n\nInstitute Overview, Administration, Campus, Admissions\n\n1. Institute Overview\n\nDefinition\n\nIIT Jodhpur is one of the second-generation Indian Institutes of Technology established in 2008 by the Government of India. It is an Institute of National Importance focused on education, research, innovation, entrepreneurship, and interdisciplinary learning.\n\nVision'), Document(id='caf927a8-e3fe-40d6-9733-0de5c6fe5806', metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/data/Doc 10_ IIT Jodhpur Admissions & Fee Guide.docx'}, page_content='Document 10: IIT Jodhpur Admissions & Fee Guide\n\n\n\nIIT Jodhpur Admissions and Fee Guide\n\nOverview\n\nThis document provides information regarding the admission process, fee payment, scholarships, registration, and important procedures for students joining IIT Jodhpur.\n\n\n\n1. Admission Process\n\nAdmission to IIT Jodhpur is conducted through national-level admission processes depending on the academic programme.\n\nUndergraduate (B.Tech)\n\nAdmission is based on JEE Advanced.\n\nSeat allocation is conducted through JoSAA counselling.\n\nVacant seats may be filled through CSAB counselling.\n\nPostgraduate\n\nAdmissions for postgraduate programmes are generally based on:\n\nGATE\n\nJAM\n\nCAT\n\nCEED\n\nInstitute admission procedures\n\ndepending upon the programme.\n\n\n\n2. Seat Acceptance Process'), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Doc 10_ IIT Jodhpur Admissions & Fee Guide.docx'}, page_content="7. Fee Payment\n\nFee payment is usually completed through the institute's online payment portal.\n\nStudents should:\n\nVerify fee details.\n\nComplete payment before the deadline.\n\nSave payment receipts.\n\nCheck payment confirmation.\n\nLate fee payment may attract penalties.\n\n\n\n8. Refund Policy\n\nFee refunds are governed by institute regulations and applicable national guidelines.\n\nRefund eligibility depends on:\n\nDate of withdrawal\n\nAdmission status\n\nAcademic calendar\n\nApplicable refund rules\n\nStudents should consult official notifications before requesting withdrawal.\n\n\n\n9. Scholarships\n\nStudents may be eligible for various scholarships depending on eligibility criteria.\n\nExamples include:\n\nMerit Scholarships\n\nGovernment Scholarships\n\nSC/ST Scholarships\n\nOBC Scholarships\n\nEWS Scholarships"), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Doc 10_ IIT Jodhpur Admissions & Fee Guide.docx'}, page_content='Document 10: IIT Jodhpur Admissions & Fee Guide\n\n\n\nIIT Jodhpur Admissions and Fee Guide\n\nOverview\n\nThis document provides information regarding the admission process, fee payment, scholarships, registration, and important procedures for students joining IIT Jodhpur.\n\n\n\n1. Admission Process\n\nAdmission to IIT Jodhpur is conducted through national-level admission processes depending on the academic programme.\n\nUndergraduate (B.Tech)\n\nAdmission is based on JEE Advanced.\n\nSeat allocation is conducted through JoSAA counselling.\n\nVacant seats may be filled through CSAB counselling.\n\nPostgraduate\n\nAdmissions for postgraduate programmes are generally based on:\n\nGATE\n\nJAM\n\nCAT\n\nCEED\n\nInstitute admission procedures\n\ndepending upon the programme.\n\n\n\n2. Seat Acceptance Process'), Document(id='48a28ba4-c286-4dab-b7e6-70fda5e38f48', metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/data/DOCiitj  9.docx'}, page_content='Admissions\n\nQ: How is B.Tech admission conducted at IIT Jodhpur?\n A: B.Tech admission is based on JEE Advanced ranks through JoSAA counselling. Vacant seats may be filled through CSAB according to applicable rules.\n\n\n\nQ: Which documents are required during admission?\n A: Students generally need academic certificates, allotment letter, identity proof, passport-size photographs, and applicable category certificates.\n\n\n\nQ: What happens after seat allotment?\n A: Students must accept the seat, pay the required fee, upload documents, and complete institute registration.\n\n\n\nFees\n\nQ: What does the semester fee include?\n A: The semester fee generally includes tuition fees, institute fees, hostel fees (if applicable), mess charges, examination fees, and other student charges.'), Document(id='dcf54351-0ba0-469e-980e-a2af69f179b5', metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/data/DOCiitj  9.docx'}, page_content='Q. Is IIT Jodhpur a residential campus?\n\nA. Yes, most undergraduate students stay in institute hostels.\n\nQ. How can I reach the campus?\n\nA. Students usually travel by road from the airport or railway station.\n\nAdmissions\n\nQ. How do I get admission to B.Tech?\n\nA. Admission is through JEE Advanced followed by JoSAA counselling.\n\nQ. What documents are required during admission?\n\nA. Typical documents include identity proof, educational certificates and admission-related documents.\n\nQ. Can I change my branch?\n\nA. Branch change depends on institute regulations and eligibility.\n\nQ. When does academic registration happen?\n\nA. Registration is conducted according to the academic calendar.\n\nAcademics\n\nQ. What is SGPA?\n\nA. Semester Grade Point Average for one semester.\n\nQ. What is CGPA?'), Document(id='fa5f7811-bcfc-4e45-a5a9-deb89fc31e92', metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/data/Document_8_Policies_and_Regulations.docx'}, page_content='IIT Jodhpur RAG Knowledge Base\n\nDOCUMENT 8\n\nPolicies, Academic Regulations, Hostel Rules, Code of Conduct & Student Wellbeing\n\nMetadata\n\nField\n\nValue\n\nDomain\n\nPolicies & Regulations\n\nPurpose\n\nProduction-ready RAG Knowledge Base\n\nAudience\n\nStudents, Parents, Faculty\n\nSource\n\nOfficial IIT Jodhpur information where applicable, with general explanatory content\n\n1. Academic Regulations\n\nAcademic regulations define how programmes are conducted. Students should always refer to the latest official regulations for binding rules.\n\nSemester-based academic system\n\nCourse registration within announced deadlines\n\nContinuous evaluation\n\nAttendance requirements as notified\n\nExaminations and grading\n\nAcademic integrity\n\n2. Academic Integrity\n\nDo not plagiarize assignments or reports.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Doc 10_ IIT Jodhpur Admissions & Fee Guide.docx'}, page_content="Students register for their courses at the beginning of every semester.\n\nAcademic registration includes:\n\nCourse selection\n\nCredit registration\n\nFaculty advisor approval\n\nSemester activation\n\nFailure to register may affect semester enrollment.\n\n\n\n6. Fee Structure\n\nStudent fees generally consist of multiple components.\n\nTypical fee categories include:\n\nTuition Fee\n\nHostel Fee\n\nMess Charges\n\nInstitute Fee\n\nExamination Fee\n\nMedical Fee\n\nStudent Activity Fee\n\nLibrary Charges\n\nSecurity Deposit (if applicable)\n\nThe exact fee structure depends on:\n\nProgramme\n\nCategory\n\nScholarship status\n\nSemester\n\nStudents should always refer to the latest official fee notification.\n\n\n\n7. Fee Payment\n\nFee payment is usually completed through the institute's online payment portal.\n\nStudents should:"), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Document_7_Placements_Career_and_Alumni.docx'}, page_content='IIT Jodhpur RAG Knowledge Base\n\nDOCUMENT 7\n\nPlacements, Internships, Career Development, Alumni & Higher Studies\n\nMetadata\n\nField\n\nValue\n\nDomain\n\nPlacements & Career\n\nPurpose\n\nProduction-ready RAG Knowledge Base\n\nAudience\n\nStudents & Recruiters\n\nSource\n\nOfficial IIT Jodhpur information with expanded explanatory content\n\n1. Career Development\n\nIIT Jodhpur encourages students to prepare for careers through academics, projects, internships, technical competitions, research experience and industry interaction. Career preparation begins well before the final placement season.\n\n2. Placement Process\n\nCompany registration with institute\n\nJob announcement\n\nStudent registration\n\nResume submission\n\nShortlisting\n\nOnline tests\n\nTechnical interviews\n\nHR interviews\n\nOffer release\n\nOffer acceptance'), Document(id='23ac09fb-5504-4682-8c35-d541b7ebb815', metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/data/Document_4_Campus_Life_and_Facilities.docx'}, page_content='Textbooks\n\nReference books\n\nDigital library\n\nResearch journals\n\nReading halls\n\nOnline databases\n\n4. Healthcare\n\nThe campus medical centre provides basic healthcare support. Students should use official emergency contacts published by the institute for urgent assistance.\n\nMedical consultation\n\nFirst aid\n\nEmergency support\n\nHealth awareness\n\n5. Sports & Recreation\n\nCricket\n\nFootball\n\nBasketball\n\nBadminton\n\nVolleyball\n\nAthletics\n\nIndoor games\n\nFitness facilities\n\n6. Transportation\n\nStudents generally reach the campus by taxi, cab or bus from Jodhpur city, railway station or airport.\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\n\nQ. Is IIT Jodhpur residential?\n\nA. Yes, it is primarily a residential campus.\n\nQ. Is Wi-Fi available in hostels?\n\nA. Internet connectivity is available for academic use.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Doc 10_ IIT Jodhpur Admissions & Fee Guide.docx'}, page_content='Examples include:\n\nMerit Scholarships\n\nGovernment Scholarships\n\nSC/ST Scholarships\n\nOBC Scholarships\n\nEWS Scholarships\n\nFinancial Assistance Schemes\n\nScholarship eligibility depends on institute and government regulations.\n\n\n\n10. Student Identity Card\n\nEvery admitted student receives an institute identity card.\n\nThe ID card is generally required for:\n\nHostel access\n\nLibrary access\n\nExamination verification\n\nCampus entry\n\nLaboratory access\n\nStudents should carry their ID card while on campus.\n\n\n\n11. Institute Email\n\nEvery student receives an official institute email account.\n\nInstitute email is commonly used for:\n\nAcademic notifications\n\nCourse announcements\n\nExamination information\n\nPlacement updates\n\nOfficial communication\n\nStudents are advised to regularly check their institute email.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Document_1_IITJ_Knowledge_Base.docx'}, page_content='IIT Jodhpur Knowledge Base\n\nDocument 1: Institute Overview, Administration, Campus Overview & Admissions\nVersion: 1.0\nPurpose: Production-ready RAG Knowledge Base\nSource: Official IIT Jodhpur website (expanded with explanatory content)\n\n\nMetadata\n\nField\n\nValue\n\nKnowledge Domain\n\nInstitutional Information\n\nAudience\n\nProspective students, current students, parents, visitors\n\nDocument Format\n\nRAG Optimized\n\nTopics\n\nInstitute Overview, Administration, Campus, Admissions\n\n1. Institute Overview\n\nDefinition\n\nIIT Jodhpur is one of the second-generation Indian Institutes of Technology established in 2008 by the Government of India. It is an Institute of National Importance focused on education, research, innovation, entrepreneurship, and interdisciplinary learning.\n\nVision'), Document(id='ce7b6ebf-9d6c-493d-a109-1ac9e031dd61', metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/data/Document_3_Departments_and_Schools.docx'}, page_content='IIT Jodhpur RAG Knowledge Base\n\nDOCUMENT 3\n\nDepartments, Schools, Research Areas & Career Opportunities\n\nMetadata\n\nField\n\nValue\n\nDomain\n\nDepartments\n\nPurpose\n\nRAG Knowledge Base\n\nAudience\n\nStudents & Applicants\n\nSource\n\nOfficial IIT Jodhpur information with expanded explanations\n\nComputer Science & Engineering\n\nThe Computer Science & Engineering department provides undergraduate, postgraduate and research opportunities with emphasis on innovation, interdisciplinary learning and industry collaboration.\n\nResearch Areas\n\nArtificial Intelligence\n\nMachine Learning\n\nCyber Security\n\nComputer Vision\n\nSoftware Engineering\n\nStudent Opportunities\n\nFaculty-guided research\n\nSummer internships\n\nTechnical competitions\n\nOpen-source contributions\n\nIndustry projects\n\nCareer Opportunities\n\nSoftware Engineer'), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Document_1_IITJ_Knowledge_Base.docx'}, page_content='Board of Governors\n\nSenate\n\nDirector\n\nRegistrar\n\nAcademic Departments\n\n3. Campus Overview\n\nThe permanent campus is located near Karwar village outside Jodhpur city and includes academic buildings, hostels, laboratories, library, sports facilities, medical centre and student activity spaces.\n\n4. Admissions\n\nAdmission Process\n\nQualify JEE Main (eligibility for JEE Advanced).\n\nAppear for JEE Advanced.\n\nRegister through JoSAA.\n\nParticipate in choice filling and seat allocation.\n\nComplete fee payment and document verification.\n\nReport to IIT Jodhpur and complete hostel registration.\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\n\nQ. What is JoSAA?\n\nA. The Joint Seat Allocation Authority coordinates admissions into IITs and other participating institutes.\n\nQ. Is IIT Jodhpur residential?'), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Document_2_Academics_Full.docx'}, page_content='IIT Jodhpur RAG Knowledge Base\n\nDOCUMENT 2\nAcademics • Academic Structure • Programmes • Schools • Academic Regulations\n\n\nMetadata\n\nField\n\nValue\n\nPurpose\n\nProduction-ready RAG knowledge base\n\nPrimary Source\n\nOfficial IIT Jodhpur website with expanded explanations\n\nAudience\n\nStudents, parents, faculty, applicants\n\nDomain\n\nAcademics\n\n1. Academic Philosophy\n\nIIT Jodhpur follows an outcome-based academic system that combines strong theoretical foundations with laboratory work, design thinking, interdisciplinary learning, research exposure and innovation. Students are encouraged to solve real engineering and societal problems instead of focusing only on examinations.\n\nResearch-integrated curriculum\n\nIndustry interaction\n\nProject-based learning\n\nInnovation and entrepreneurship'), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Document_5_Student_Life_Clubs_and_Festivals.docx'}, page_content='IIT Jodhpur RAG Knowledge Base\n\nDOCUMENT 5\n\nStudent Life, Clubs, Gymkhana, Sports, Cultural Activities & Festivals\n\nMetadata\n\nField\n\nValue\n\nDomain\n\nStudent Life\n\nPurpose\n\nRAG Knowledge Base\n\nAudience\n\nCurrent & Prospective Students\n\nSource\n\nOfficial IIT Jodhpur information with expanded explanations\n\n1. Student Life\n\nLife at IIT Jodhpur extends beyond academics. Students participate in technical, cultural, sports, entrepreneurial and social activities that help develop leadership, teamwork and communication skills.\n\n2. Student Gymkhana\n\nThe Student Gymkhana coordinates many student activities through elected or nominated student bodies. It supports clubs, events, competitions and student initiatives.\n\n3. Student Clubs\n\nProgramming Club\n\nRobotics Club\n\nSAE / Automobile Club'), Document(id='6177af90-2d7b-44ff-bde1-68d63c78f01f', metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/data/Document_4_Campus_Life_and_Facilities.docx'}, page_content='IIT Jodhpur RAG Knowledge Base\n\nDOCUMENT 4\n\nHostels, Dining, Library, Healthcare, Campus Facilities & Transportation\n\nMetadata\n\nField\n\nValue\n\nDomain\n\nCampus Life\n\nPurpose\n\nRAG Knowledge Base\n\nAudience\n\nStudents, Parents, Visitors\n\nSource\n\nOfficial IIT Jodhpur information with expanded explanations\n\n1. Hostels\n\nIIT Jodhpur is a residential campus where most students stay in institute hostels. Hostel life supports academics, collaboration and extracurricular activities.\n\nFurnished rooms\n\nWi-Fi/LAN connectivity\n\nReading rooms\n\nCommon rooms\n\nIndoor games\n\nGymnasium access\n\nLaundry facilities (where available)\n\n24×7 security\n\nHostel Guidelines\n\nCarry institute ID card.\n\nFollow hostel discipline and quiet hours.\n\nMaintain cleanliness.\n\nReport maintenance issues to hostel office.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Document_4_Campus_Life_and_Facilities.docx'}, page_content='Textbooks\n\nReference books\n\nDigital library\n\nResearch journals\n\nReading halls\n\nOnline databases\n\n4. Healthcare\n\nThe campus medical centre provides basic healthcare support. Students should use official emergency contacts published by the institute for urgent assistance.\n\nMedical consultation\n\nFirst aid\n\nEmergency support\n\nHealth awareness\n\n5. Sports & Recreation\n\nCricket\n\nFootball\n\nBasketball\n\nBadminton\n\nVolleyball\n\nAthletics\n\nIndoor games\n\nFitness facilities\n\n6. Transportation\n\nStudents generally reach the campus by taxi, cab or bus from Jodhpur city, railway station or airport.\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\n\nQ. Is IIT Jodhpur residential?\n\nA. Yes, it is primarily a residential campus.\n\nQ. Is Wi-Fi available in hostels?\n\nA. Internet connectivity is available for academic use.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Doc 10_ IIT Jodhpur Admissions & Fee Guide.docx'}, page_content="How is fee payment completed?\n\nFee payment is generally completed through the institute's online payment portal before the prescribed deadline.\n\n\n\nCan students receive scholarships?\n\nYes. Eligible students may receive institute or government scholarships depending on applicable rules.\n\n\n\nIs hostel allotted after admission?\n\nHostel allocation is generally completed during the admission and registration process, subject to institute policies.\n\n\n\nWhat happens after admission?\n\nStudents complete institute registration, hostel allocation, academic registration, and begin semester activities.\n\n\n\nKeywords\n\nAdmissions\n\nB.Tech Admission\n\nJoSAA\n\nCSAB\n\nJEE Advanced\n\nRegistration\n\nFee Structure\n\nScholarships\n\nDocuments Required\n\nInstitute Registration\n\nCourse Registration\n\nFee Payment"), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Doc 10_ IIT Jodhpur Admissions & Fee Guide.docx'}, page_content='GATE\n\nJAM\n\nCAT\n\nCEED\n\nInstitute admission procedures\n\ndepending upon the programme.\n\n\n\n2. Seat Acceptance Process\n\nAfter seat allotment, candidates are generally required to:\n\nAccept the allotted seat.\n\nPay the required admission fee.\n\nUpload required documents.\n\nReport to the institute within the specified schedule.\n\nComplete physical verification if required.\n\nFailure to complete these steps may result in cancellation of admission.\n\n\n\n3. Required Documents\n\nStudents may be required to submit the following documents during admission.\n\nClass X Certificate\n\nClass XII Certificate\n\nJEE Advanced Rank Card\n\nJoSAA/CSAB Allotment Letter\n\nTransfer Certificate\n\nMigration Certificate\n\nCategory Certificate (if applicable)\n\nPwD Certificate (if applicable)\n\nPassport Size Photographs'), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Document_2_Academics_Programmes_Schools_Part1.docx'}, page_content='IIT Jodhpur Knowledge Base\n\nDocument 2: Academics, Programmes & Schools (Part 1)\n\nMetadata\n\nField\n\nValue\n\nKnowledge Domain\n\nAcademics\n\nAudience\n\nProspective and Current Students\n\nPurpose\n\nRAG Knowledge Base\n\nTopics\n\nAcademic Structure, Programmes, Schools, Credits\n\n1. Academic Philosophy\n\nIIT Jodhpur emphasizes multidisciplinary education, research-led learning, innovation, industry collaboration, and problem-solving. Students are encouraged to combine classroom learning with laboratory work, projects, internships, entrepreneurship and research.\n\n2. Academic Structure\n\nSemester-based academic system\n\nCredit-based curriculum\n\nCore, elective and laboratory courses\n\nProject-based learning\n\nContinuous assessment through quizzes, assignments and examinations\n\n3. Academic Programmes\n\nProgramme'), Document(id='5a683ff5-1e03-4057-9f89-b9b4ad94827c', metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/data/Document_6_Research_Innovation_and_Labs.docx'}, page_content='IIT Jodhpur RAG Knowledge Base\n\nDOCUMENT 6\n\nResearch, Laboratories, Innovation, Incubation, Startups & Sponsored Projects\n\nMetadata\n\nField\n\nValue\n\nDomain\n\nResearch & Innovation\n\nPurpose\n\nRAG Knowledge Base\n\nAudience\n\nStudents, Researchers, Industry\n\nSource\n\nOfficial IIT Jodhpur information with expanded explanations\n\n1. Research at IIT Jodhpur\n\nResearch is a core pillar of IIT Jodhpur. The institute encourages interdisciplinary collaboration across engineering, sciences, healthcare, artificial intelligence, energy, design and entrepreneurship. Students can participate in faculty-led projects, internships and innovation challenges.\n\n2. Major Research Themes\n\nArtificial Intelligence & Data Science\n\nCyber Physical Systems\n\nClean Energy & Sustainability\n\nAdvanced Materials'), Document(metadata={'source': '/Users/bhuvanachandra/Desktop/iitj_chat_bot/iitj_v1/data/data_iitj/Document_7_Placements_Career_and_Alumni.docx'}, page_content='Student registration\n\nResume submission\n\nShortlisting\n\nOnline tests\n\nTechnical interviews\n\nHR interviews\n\nOffer release\n\nOffer acceptance\n\n3. Internship Opportunities\n\nSummer internships\n\nWinter internships\n\nResearch internships\n\nIndustry internships\n\nStartup internships\n\nGovernment laboratory internships\n\nBenefits of Internships\n\nPractical experience\n\nIndustry exposure\n\nProfessional networking\n\nResume building\n\nPotential Pre-Placement Offers (PPOs)\n\n4. Placement Preparation\n\nData Structures & Algorithms\n\nCore engineering subjects\n\nMock interviews\n\nResume preparation\n\nAptitude practice\n\nCommunication skills\n\nProject portfolio\n\n5. Higher Studies')]

